OL,3,GNEWSASikh riders mark 50 years of
OL,4,Ahelmet exemption
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 20 Sikh motorcyclists have taken
OL,7,Fpart in a ride marking 50 years since a
OL,8,FManchester Sikh campaigner helped
OL,9,Fsecure a change to motorcycle helmet
OL,10,Flaws.
OL,12,FThe group travelled from Strangeways
OL,13,FPrison, near Manchester city centre, to
OL,14,Fthe Sikh temple Sri Guru Gobind Singh
OL,15,FGurdwara in the south of the city in
OL,16,Fhonour of campaigner Gyani Sundar Singh
OL,17,FSagar.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1790056569
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASikh riders mark 50 years of
OL,4,Ahelmet exemption
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnown as Gyani Ji, he spent a week in
OL,7,FStrangeways in 1976 for refusing to pay
OL,8,Ffines for riding his moped while
OL,9,Fwearing a turban instead of a crash
OL,10,Fhelmet, his son Bharat Sagar said.
OL,12,FAnother son, Ujjal Singh, who was there
OL,13,Fwhen he was released, said returning to
OL,14,Fthe spot 50 years later was "quite
OL,15,Fnostalgic" and he was proud his
OL,16,Ffather's legacy lived on.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
